y duration\\n- Consistent with existing color scheme and design system\\n\\n## Assumptions\\n- Whimsical names are already stored in the agent metadata\\n- Current toast system allows for custom text styling"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01LtYDaBmujhuu89WA4j93X7', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Achievement Toast Customization', 'description': "Modify achievement toast display to emphasize agent's whimsical name while subtly indicating agent type"}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01LtYDaBmujhuu89WA4j93X7', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "78b26ef7", "message": "Created project: Achievement Toast Customization", "summary": {"project_id": "78b26ef7", "project_name": "Achievement Toast Customization", "description": "Modify achievement toast display to emphasize agent\'s whimsical name while subtly indicating agent type", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-15T02:57:05.227292", "updated_at": "2026-01-15T02:57:05.227292", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-15T02:57:05.227292", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Achievement Toast Customization\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_014pXabGB5qpxBYMw1fouDK8', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'project_name': 'Achievement Toast Customization', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_014pXab