ial backoff\\n- Optimized API endpoint for file list retrieval\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- Consistent file pane updates\\n- Reduced network overhead\\n- No connection-related UI glitches\\n- Graceful handling of network interruptions"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Gaib32HUaQz1HGDCuF2Mhe', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Ensemble UI File Pane Stability Improvement', 'description': 'Replace current file update mechanism with a robust solution using efficient backend tracking and intelligent polling to eliminate stability issues in the files pane'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Gaib32HUaQz1HGDCuF2Mhe', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "69ceb950", "message": "Created project: Ensemble UI File Pane Stability Improvement", "summary": {"project_id": "69ceb950", "project_name": "Ensemble UI File Pane Stability Improvement", "description": "Replace current file update mechanism with a robust solution using efficient backend tracking and intelligent polling to eliminate stability issues in the files pane", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-15T02:59:01.472605", "updated_at": "2026-01-15T02:59:01.472605", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-15T02:59:01.472605", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Ensemble UI File Pane Stability Improvement\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01CqeeuSjyRYw4xSmTLQGncf', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_note', 'project_id': '69ceb950', 'category': 'general', 'note': 'Starting project to improve file pane stability. Requirements call for replacing unstable update mechanism with hybrid approach using efficient ba