hange tracking\\n- Controlled, intelligent polling with exponential backoff\\n- Optimized API endpoint for file list retrieval\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- Consistent file pane updates\\n- Reduced network overhead\\n- No connection-related UI glitches\\n- Graceful handling of network interruptions"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01UqA7dHCYLQrmz3exsNmVUC', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'get_summary', 'project_id': '4683ca3b'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01UqA7dHCYLQrmz3exsNmVUC', 'content': '{"success": true, "summary": {"project_id": "4683ca3b", "project_name": "Achievement Toast Customization", "description": "Modify achievement toasts to display agent\'s whimsical name with subtle agent type reference", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-15T02:56:45.173232", "updated_at": "2026-01-15T02:58:52.101007", "task_counts": {"total": 1, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 1, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-15T02:58:52.101003", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Failed to spawn code_writer. System does not recognize this agent type. Attempting alternative approach with Development Manager.", "category": "issue"}, {"timestamp": "2026-01-15T02:58:42.730543", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Task \'Implement updated achievement toast display with whimsical agent names\' status: todo \\u2192 in_progress - Retrying Development Manager spawn after previous system communication issue", "category": "general"}, {"timestamp": "2026-01-15T02:58:33.886291", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Failed to spawn Development Manager. Encountered system request formatting issue. May require manual intervention or retry.", "category": "issue"}, {"timestamp": "2026-01-15T02:56:55.161896", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Added task: Implement updated achievement toast display with whimsical agent names", "category": "general"}, {"timestamp": "2026-01-15T02:56:45.173232", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Achievement Toast Customization\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01TjCyKgWWk8r9cAM5Vwr1cY', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# Achievement Toast Customization - Milestone Plan\n\n## Project Overview\n**Project**: Achievement Toast Customization  \n**Objective**: Modify AchievementToast component to display whimsical agent names prominently  \n**Total Estimated Duration**: 1-2 days  \n\n## Milestone 1: Component Analysis and Design (Day 1 - Morning)\n**Objective**: Understand current implementation and design the enhanced toast component\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Analysis of current AchievementToast component structure\n- Design specification for whimsical name display\n- UI/UX mockups or specifications\n- Technical approach document\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Current component code is analyzed and documented\n- Design clearly shows where and how whimsical names will be displayed\n- Technical approach is validated and approved\n- Dependencies and integration points are identified\n\n**Dependencies**: None\n\n## Milestone 2: Component Implementation (Day 1 - Afternoon to Day 2)\n**Objective**: Implement the modified AchievementToast component with prominent whimsical agent name display\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Updated AchievementToast component\n- Enhanced styling for prominent name display\n- Integration with agent name service/data\n- Unit tests for new functionality\n- Integration tests for toast display\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Component displays whimsical agent names prominently\n- Agent type is subtly referenced as specified\n- Visual design is polished and user-friendly\n- All tests pass\n- Component integrates seamlessly with existing system\n- Performance impact is minimal\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 1 completion\n\n## Risk Assessment\n- **Low Risk**: Component modification is well-scoped\n- **Medium Risk**: Ensuring proper agent name data integration\n- **Low Risk**: Visual design alignment with existing UI\n\n## Success Metrics\n- Whimsical agent names are clearly visible in achievement toasts\n- User experience is enhanced without disruption\n- Code quality and test coverage maintained\n- Zero regression issues in existing toast functionality'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01TjCyKgWWk8r9cAM5Vwr1cY', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260115_025913.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260115_025913.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', 'system': 'You are a Development Manager agent.\n\n## Purpose\nDrives implementation from requirements through delivery. Breaks projects into milestones, identifies requirements gaps, drives architecture via System Architect and task breakdown via Coordinators, then coordinates with TDD Coordinator for implementation. Reports to Executive Director.\n\n## Instructions\nYou drive the show from concept through performance. Report to Executive Director, coordinate System Architect/Coordinators/TDD Coordinator.\n\n**CRITICAL RULES:**\n1. **NEVER write code yourself** - you lack can_write_code permission\n2. **If spawn_agent fails, STOP and return error** - DO NOT write code as fallback\n3. **Execute ALL steps sequentially** - don\'t stop after planning\n4. **Use EXACT agent paths** - see examples below\n5. **SPAWN VALIDATION REQUI