{"timestamp": "2026-01-15 03:00:45", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-e43cde19-0e36-4abb-8b31-422ea51434c1', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "requirements_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "project_name": "Achievement Toast Customization",\n  "project_id": "4683ca3b",\n  "specific_task": "Modify AchievementToast component to display whimsical agent names prominently"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Ec1mLBgRVMLpvidX2zDHhg', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Ec1mLBgRVMLpvidX2zDHhg', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# File Pane Stability Improvement Requirements\\n\\n## Problem Statement\\nThe generated files pane is experiencing stability issues, potentially due to unreliable update mechanisms like polling or websockets.\\n\\n## Objectives\\n1. Replace current file update mechanism with a more robust solution\\n2. Ensure real-time or near-real-time file updates\\n3. Minimize performance overhead\\n4. Eliminate potential connection/synchronization issues\\n\\n## Constraints\\n- Do not use WebSockets\\n- Maintain current UI/UX experience\\n- Minimize additional backend complexity\\n\\n## Proposed Solution\\nImplement a hybrid approach using:\\n- Efficient backend file change tracking\\n- Controlled, intelligent polling with exponential backoff\\n- Optimized API endpoint for file list retrieval\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- Consistent file pane updates\\n- Reduced network overhead\\n- No connection-related UI glitches\\n- Graceful handling of network interruptions"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01UqA7dHCYLQrmz3exsNmVUC', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'get_summary', 'project_id': '4683ca3b'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01UqA7dHCYLQrmz3exsNmVUC', 'content': '{"success": true, "summary": {"project_id": "4683ca3b", "project_name": "Achievement Toast Customization", "description": "Modify achievement toasts to display agent\'s whimsical name with subtle agent type reference", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-15T02:56:45.173232", "updated_at": "2026-01-15T02:58:52.101007", "task_counts": {"total": 1, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 1, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-15T02:58:52.101003", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Failed to spawn code_writer. System does not recognize this agent type. Attempting alternative approach with Development Manager.", "category": "issue"}, {"timestamp": "2026-01-15T02:58:42.730543", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Task \'Implement updated achievement toast display with whimsical agent names\' status: todo \\u2192 in_progress - Retrying Development Manager spawn after previous system communication issue", "category": "general"}, {"timestamp": "2026-01-15T02:58:33.886291", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Failed to spawn Development Manager. Encountered system request formatting issue. May require manual intervention or retry.", "category": "issue"}, {"timestamp": "2026-01-15T02:56:55.161896", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Added task: Implement updated achievement toast display with whimsical agent names", "category": "general"}, {"timestamp": "2026-01-15T02:56:45.173232", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Achievement Toast Customization\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01TjCyKgWWk8r9cAM5Vwr1cY', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# Achievement Toast Customization - Milestone Plan\n\n## Project Overview\n**Project**: Achievement Toast Customization  \n**Objective**: Modify AchievementToast component to display whimsical agent names prominently  \n**Total Estimated Duration**: 1-2 days  \n\n## Milestone 1: Component Analysis and Design (Day 1 - Morning)\n**Objective**: Understand current implementation and design the enhanced toast component\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Analysis of current AchievementToast component structure\n- Design specification for whimsical name display\n- UI/UX mockups or specifications\n- Technical approach document\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Current component code is analyzed and documented\n- Design clearly shows where and how whimsical names will be displayed\n- Technical approach is validated and approved\n- Dependencies and integration points are identified\n\n**Dependencies**: None\n\n## Milestone 2: Component Implementation (Day 1 - Afternoon to Day 2)\n**Objective**: Implement the modified AchievementToast component with prominent whimsical agent name display\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Updated AchievementToast component\n- Enhanced styling for prominent name display\n- Integration with agent name service/data\n- Unit tests for new functionality\n- Integration tests for toast display\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Component displays whimsical agent names prominently\n- Agent type is subtly referenced as specified\n- Visual design is polished and user-friendly\n- All