{"timestamp": "2026-01-15 03:02:55", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-6adda6ff-99e9-413e-86bd-8eeaba13903f', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "requirements_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "project_name": "Famous Mustards Achievements"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01RwLnaCUkPrqUQVaQLBMLNd', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01RwLnaCUkPrqUQVaQLBMLNd', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Famous Mustards Achievements - Requirements\\n\\n## Project Vision\\nAdd 10 new achievements from the category \\"famous mustards\\" to the existing achievement system in the ensemble project.\\n\\n## Objectives\\n1. Create a new achievement category `FAMOUS_MUSTARDS` in the existing system\\n2. Design 10 thematic achievements based on famous mustard varieties and mustard-related concepts\\n3. Integrate these achievements into the existing achievement tracking system\\n4. Ensure achievements follow the established pattern and quality standards\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n### In Scope\\n- Add `FAMOUS_MUSTARDS` to the `AchievementCategory` enum\\n- Create 10 new achievement definitions with:\\n  - Unique IDs related to mustard themes\\n  - Creative names referencing famous mustard types/brands\\n  - Descriptive text that ties mustard concepts to agent behaviors\\n  - Appropriate rarity levels (mix of common to legendary)\\n  - Relevant icons (mustard/food related emojis)\\n  - Point values consistent with existing system\\n  - Trigger conditions that make sense in context\\n\\n### Out of Scope\\n- Modifying the achievement tracking logic or database schema\\n- Changing the UI components for displaying achievements\\n- Adding achievements in other categories\\n- Modifying existing achievements\\n\\n## Requirements\\n\\n### Functional Requirements\\n\\n**R1: Category Addition**\\n- Add `FAMOUS_MUSTARDS = \\"famous_mustards\\"` to the AchievementCategory enum\\n\\n**R2: Achievement Definitions**\\n- Create exactly 10 new Achievement objects\\n- Each must reference famous mustard varieties (Dijon, Yellow, Honey Mustard, Spicy Brown, etc.)\\n- Names should be creative but clearly mustard-themed\\n- Descriptions should cleverly relate mustard characteristics to agent behaviors\\n- Must follow existing achievement patterns and structure\\n\\n**R3: Quality Standards**\\n- Achievements should have varied rarity levels (suggested: 3-4 common, 3-4 uncommon, 2-3 rare, 0-1 epic/legendary)\\n- Point values should align with rarity (10-15 common, 20-35 uncommon, 40-60 rare, 75+ epic/legendary)\\n- Icons should be food/mustard related emojis\\n- Trigger conditions should be realistic and achievable\\n\\n### Technical Requirements\\n\\n**T1: Code Integration**\\n- Achievements must be added to the existing ACHIEVEMENTS list in achievements.py\\n- Follow existing code structure and formatting\\n- No breaking changes to existing functionality\\n\\n**T2: Naming Conventions**\\n- Achievement IDs should follow snake_case pattern\\n- IDs should be descriptive and mustard-themed\\n- Names should be title case and engaging\\n\\n### Constraints\\n\\n**C1: System Compatibility**\\n- Must work with existing achievement tracking system\\n- Cannot modify database schema or core tracking logic\\n- Must use existing trigger condition patterns\\n\\n**C2: Theme Consistency**\\n- All achievements must be mustard-themed\\n- Should maintain the humorous, gaming-style tone of existing achievements\\n- Must fit naturally with the existing achievement ecosystem\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n\\n1. \\u2705 10 new achievements added to the system\\n2. \\u2705 All achievements are mustard-themed and creative\\n3. \\u2705 Code integrates cleanly without breaking existing functionality\\n4. \\u2705 Achievements follow established patterns for structure and quality\\n5. \\u2705 Mixed rarity distribution provides progression incentives\\n6. \\u2705 Trigger conditions are realistic and varied\\n\\n## Assumptions\\n\\n- The existing achievement system architecture will not change\\n- The mustard theme should be applied broadly (types, brands, characteristics, uses)\\n- Achievements should maintain the existing humorous and gaming-inspired tone\\n- Standard software development practices will be followed\\n\\n## Technical Context\\n\\nThe system already has these achievement categories:\\n- SKA, BRASS_BAND, DRUM_CORPS, GUITAR_HERO (music-themed)\\n- PRODUCTIVITY, COMEDY, MILESTONE, STREAK, META (behavior-themed)\\n\\nThe new FAMOUS_MUSTARDS category will join this list and achievements will be added to the main ACHIEVEMENTS list in `/src/runtime/agents/achievements.py`."}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01MBK3HYYYFSZZDRV8dqBQYK', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# Famous Mustards Achievements - Milestone Plan\n\n## Project Overview\nAdd 10 new mustard-themed achievements to the existing ensemble achievement system.\n\n## Milestone 1: Foundation Setup (Quick Start)\n**Objective**: Establish the FAMOUS_MUSTARDS category and basic structure\n**Estimated Effort**: 2 hours\n\n### Deliverables\n- Add `FAMOUS_MUSTARDS` category to AchievementCategory enum\n- Verify existing achievement system structure\n- Prepare code foundation for new achievements\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- ✅ New category added without breaking existing system\n- ✅ Code structure validated and documented\n- ✅ Ready for achievement implementation\n\n### Dependencies\n- Access to existing codebase\n- Understanding of current achievement patterns\n\n## Milestone 2: Achievement Design & Implementation\n**Objective**: Create and implement all 10 mustard-themed achievements\n**Estimated Effort**: 4-6 hours\n\n### Deliverables\n- 10 complete Achievement objects with:\n  - Creative mustard-themed names and descriptions\n  - Appropriate rarity distribution (3-4 common, 3-4 uncommon, 2-3 rare, 0-1 epic/legendary)\n  - Relevant trigger conditions\n  - Mustard/food emojis as icons\n  - Point values aligned with rarity\n- Integration into existing ACHIEVEMENTS list\n- Code formatting and structure consistency\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- ✅ Exactly 10 achievements created\n- ✅ All achievements are mustard-themed and creative\n- ✅ Rarity distribution follows requirements (mixed levels)\n- ✅ Point values align with rarity guidelines\n- ✅ Trigger conditions are realistic and varied\n- ✅ Code follows existing patterns and formatting\n- ✅ No breaking changes to existing functionality\n\n### Dependencies\n- Milestone 1 completion\n- Understanding of mustard varieties and characteristics\n- Knowledge of existing trigger condition patterns\n\n## Milestone 3: Testing & Quality Assurance\n**Objective**: Verify system integration and achievement quality\n**Estimated Effort**: 2-3 hours\n\n### Deliverables\n- Comprehensive testing of new achievements\n- Integration testing with existing system\n- Code review and refinement\n- Documentation updates if needed\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- ✅ All achievements load correctly\n- ✅ Achievement tracking works properly\n- ✅ No conflicts with existing achievements\n- ✅ Code quality meets standards\n- ✅ Achievement descriptions are engaging and thematic\n\n### Dependencies\n- Milestone 2 completion\n- Testing framework access\n\n## Overall Success Metrics\n- 10 new mustard-themed achievements successfully integrated\n- System maintains full backwards compatibility\n- Achievements provide engaging progression incentives\n- Code quality matches existing standards\n- Theme consistency maintained throughout\n\n## Risk Mitigation\n- **Risk**: Breaking existing achievement system\n  - **Mitigation**: Incremental integration with testing at each step\n- **Risk**: Achievements lack creativity or theme consistency  \n  - **Mitigation**: Design review phase before implementation\n- **Risk**: Point values or rarity distribution imbalanced\n  - **Mitigation**: Compare with existing achievements during design\n\n## Timeline\n- **Milestone 1**: Day 1 (2 hours)\n- **Milestone 2**: Day 1-2 (4-6 hours) \n- **Milestone 3**: Day 2 (2-3 hours)\n- **Total**: 1-2 days (8-11 hours)'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01MBK3HYYYFSZZDRV8dqBQYK', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260115_030251.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260115_030251.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01KN2T1WVUuNS2sQUwcqcdVH', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output', 'project_name': 'Famous Mustards Achievements'}}}